{"id":"a988aea7e719f061","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-speed-up-theorem.md","title":"Speed-up Theorem","display":"thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-speed-up-theorem","aliases":["72-thm-speed-up-theorem"],"display":"thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-theory-proof]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 7.1.1; printed p. 586; PDF p. 598","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"Finite proof-search contradiction checked; total-recursive monotone bound and deduction theorem accounted for","round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-speed-up-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-speed-up-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5f45b7be0b2d491\" href=\"?note=f5f45b7be0b2d491\" title=\"72-df-theory-proof\">72-df-theory-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 7.1.1; printed p. 586; PDF p. 598"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Finite proof-search contradiction checked; total-recursive monotone bound and deduction theorem accounted for"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定有效编码的一阶语言及经典一阶 Hilbert 型演算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>，其证明为有限公式序列，使用通常的逻辑公理、modus ponens 和满足自由变量限制的概括规则，并具有对句子假设的有效演绎定理。证明大小为编码符号数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为递归公理化理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为该语言的句子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\alpha\">\\(T+\\neg\\alpha\\)</span> 的定理集合不可判定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5f45b7be0b2d491\" href=\"?note=f5f45b7be0b2d491\" title=\"72-df-theory-proof\">72-df-theory-proof</a>；固定公理化的有限证明检验可判定，必要时证明代码包含公理枚举证书。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span> 为该语言句子集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 是总递归函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|\">\\(|\\pi|\\)</span> 为证明代码长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 大于所有自然数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T+\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad T+\\neg\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T+\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad T+\\neg\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_U(\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)\\},&amp;U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;U\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad(U\\in\\{T,T+\\alpha\\},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_U(\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)\\},&amp;U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;U\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad(U\\in\\{T,T+\\alpha\\},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\cap\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\;\n\\mu_T(\\varphi)\\leq f(\\mu_{T+\\alpha}(\\varphi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\cap\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\;\n\\mu_T(\\varphi)\\leq f(\\mu_{T+\\alpha}(\\varphi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 7.1.1（Ehrenfeucht and Mycielski [1971]），印刷页 586，PDF 页 598；本次核对了陈述及该页证明。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原来的量词条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\alpha\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T+\\alpha\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>，会把没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明的句子也纳入比较，甚至使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_T\">\\(\\mu_T\\)</span> 未定义。原书只比较已经在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可证的句子，现已恢复。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>证明复核：若有递归界，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\alpha\\vdash\\psi\">\\(T+\\neg\\alpha\\vdash\\psi\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\alpha\\lor\\psi\">\\(T\\vdash\\alpha\\lor\\psi\\)</span>。后者一旦成立，就由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\alpha\">\\(T+\\alpha\\)</span> 中统一可构造的短证明及假定界得到可计算的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明搜索上界，从而判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\alpha\">\\(T+\\neg\\alpha\\)</span> 的定理集合，矛盾。可将候选界取为单调闭包，并计入书中省略的固定编码常数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This is the Ehrenfeucht–Mycielski no-recursive-bound form; mere inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1\\subseteq S_2\">\\(S_1\\subseteq S_2\\)</span> does not by itself imply speed-up.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>第二轮按理论定理集合限制量化域，保证对总递归函数 f 的每个实参均为自然数，不在无穷值上调用 f。上游以 lh(π) 表示序列项数，此处 |π| 仅表示固定证明编码大小。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-theory-proof","status":"resolved","id":"f5f45b7be0b2d491","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-theory-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-theory-proof","status":"resolved","id":"f5f45b7be0b2d491","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)$ 如 [[72-df-theory-proof]]；固定公理化的有限证明检验可判定，必要时证明代码包含公理枚举证书。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\neg\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"|\\pi|","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad T+\\neg\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_U(\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)\\},&U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi,\\\\\n\\infty,&U\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad(U\\in\\{T,T+\\alpha\\},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\cap\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\;\n\\mu_T(\\varphi)\\leq f(\\mu_{T+\\alpha}(\\varphi)).","display":true},{"tex":"T+\\alpha\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\neg\\alpha\\vdash\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\alpha\\lor\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\neg\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"S_1\\subseteq S_2","display":false}],"bytes":3101,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-340","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-speed-up-theorem|thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-338","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem](72-thm-speed-up-theorem.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-366","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-speed-up-theorem|thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-548","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-speed-up-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["f5f45b7be0b2d491"]}